AgentKit-derived content
------------------------
The aif-* skills, the aif-* agents, the rules, the hooks and the installer's
runtime formats are derived from AgentKit 3.0.0-beta.35 (snapshot taken
2026-10-22; details in tools/port/snapshot.json). ainative-build redistributes
this derived content under the MIT License with the right to do so. The fork
renames every skill and agent to aif-*, removes out-of-scope skills and
AgentKit CLI dependencies, and replaces the AgentKit plan store, preferences
and hook runtime with the scripts in this repository.

